---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us - tavi-navi"
  description="Learn more about tavi-navi, your real-time travel navigation portal covering seasonal events and authentic highlights across Japan's 47 prefectures."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 4rem;">
    <article class="article-content">
      <h1 style="font-size: 1.85rem; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-primary); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        About tavi-navi
      </h1>

      <p>
        <strong>tavi-navi</strong> is a real-time Japan travel navigator dedicated to providing travelers with live, seasonal insights across all 47 prefectures of Japan.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        While many travel guides focus solely on standard tourist attractions, finding up-to-date information on seasonal blossom peaks, autumn leaves status, local weekend matsuri (festivals), and current weather/clothing advice can be difficult.
      </p>
      <p>
        tavi-navi bridges this gap by organizing timely reports, practical transit guides, cultural etiquette tips, and seasonal highlights for each prefecture, empowering both domestic wanderers and international travelers to experience Japan at its finest moment.
      </p>

      <h2>Bilingual Coverage</h2>
      <p>
        Every featured guide is curated to ensure foreign visitors can navigate Japan smoothly and respectfully. We provide actionable routes, language tips, and authentic regional cultural background.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
